 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Akuyaku Reijou ni Nanka Narimasen. Watashi wa \"Futsu\" no Koushaku Reijou desu!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "悪役令嬢になんかなりません。私は『普通』の公爵令嬢です！"
   },
   {
    "en": "I won't Become a Villainess. I'm Just a \"Normal\" Duke's Daughter!"
   },
   {
    "ko": "악역 영애 따윈 되지 않아요. 전 평범한 공작 영애예요!"
   },
   {
    "zh": "身为『普通』公爵千金的我，才不会成为恶役！"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I'm going to live an enjoyable life in this world!\"\n\nMaking full use of the game knowledge to avoid death flags, for some reason events keep happening one after another?! Contracting with spirits, helping her father, the prime minister, with his work using her modern day knowledge, taking a walk with the holy beast... and on top of all that, even starting up the heroine's event...?\n___\n**Note:** Protagonist's name begins as Rosalia, this is not a mistake.",
   "ja": "「今世こそ楽しく生きてやる！」とゲームの知識をフル活用し、フラグ回避のために動き出したが、なぜか次々と事件が発生！？精霊と契約したり、父（宰相）の仕事を現代知識で手伝ったり、成獣様とお散歩したり…挙句の果てにはヒロインイベントまで回収しちゃって…？無自覚でやらかしまくりのリンは死亡フラグをへし折れるのか…！？"
  },
